{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3380","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3380","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3380\",\"parent_revision\":\"bae89c479c476bff51e1ac0f0a3604b0aa151d7b\",\"root_revision\":\"cb9494f7dc389f2947eda20227c190532269e04953c6552e56e70517efc3307d\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: needs-grooming\\nadded: 2026-09-01\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAn agent must be able to groom every issue in a milestone/group together, gather and interview regarding cross-item questions across the whole group (not just per-item), then distribute and implement every issue in the group at the same time \u2014 with agents working across multiple worktrees in parallel remaining aware of the whole group's changes, trade-offs, and considerations as they land. This is coordinated group execution, not isolated single-item grooming/implementation under a shared label.\\n\\nMilestones are now backend-agnostic (#2287): GitHub milestones, SQLite's `milestones` table, and beads' native `epic`/`milestone` issue type all reach the same `MilestoneInfo` shape via `require_milestone_support()`. That gives this design a stable grouping primitive to build on.\\n\\nSpun off from #2287 (acceptance criterion 5) as its own design phase, not because it needs a long calendar timeline \u2014 an agent team can execute a well-specified plan in one session. It is out of scope for a mechanical refactor because the plan is not yet specified: the research questions below are unresolved design decisions, not implementation tasks, and answering them changes the shape of the resulting mechanism.\\n\\nOpen research questions for planning:\\n- What does \\\"gather and interview regarding questions of all\\\" concretely require \u2014 a shared research/discussion artifact scoped to the milestone rather than per-item?\\n- What cross-worktree awareness mechanism already in this repo (`dispatch_wave_start`, `dispatch_wave_status`, `SendMessage` between teammates) can this build on rather than reinvent?\\n- Does beads' `epic` entity need its own adapter shape for this mechanism, or does the existing `MilestoneInfo` shape suffice?\\n\\nUser-provided context: the goal is coordinated group execution across parallel worktrees, not just a shared label on otherwise-isolated items.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Spun off from #2287 (acceptance criterion 5) \u2014 its milestone-backend-agnostic refactor (PR #3364) explicitly scoped this out as a separate multi-week design project.\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-01\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"6780598b3400863cc5d25197cefa6c3edca3cd3178dc7a415f017d74c3fd7c0d\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABYnMvMA\",\"fields\":{\"followup_to\":\"\",\"close_reference\":\"\",\"added\":\"2026-09-01\",\"layer\":\"\",\"research_first\":\"\",\"source\":\"Not specified\",\"priority\":\"P2\",\"language\":\"\",\"suggested_location\":\"\",\"status\":\"needs-grooming\",\"close_reason\":\"\",\"stack\":\"\",\"item_type\":\"Feature\",\"close_comment\":\"\",\"files\":\"\",\"topic\":\"\",\"groomed\":\"\",\"plan\":\"\"}}"}